VERIFIED FLOW
-------------
AutoLab Pro starts AutocomCdpBridge.exe
 -> desktop client sends JSON over Named Pipe
 -> bridge discovers the configured USB VCI
 -> bridge connects the AUTOCOM CDP driver through VciDrivers SDK
 -> desktop displays VCI status
